Package: hotkeydaemon
Version: 1.0.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Dev1lroot <admin@dev1lroot.com>
Depends: libevdev2, libyaml-0-2
Description: Hotkey daemon for Linux
 A lightweight daemon to capture global hotkeys and execute commands.
 This runs on Linux independently of DE/WM and supports custom keymaps.
